  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP Armenia 2026 Parliamentary Elections</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNDP Armeniens parlamentsval 2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektets &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;l (effekt) &#xe4;r att bidra till att uppn&#xe5; &#xf6;kad trov&#xe4;rdighet, inkludering och h&#xe5;llbarhet i valprocessen i Armenien, vilket leder till &#xf6;kat allm&#xe4;nt f&#xf6;rtroende f&#xf6;r demokratisk samh&#xe4;llsstyrning.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective (impact) of the Project is to contribute towards achieving enhanced credibility, inclusiveness, and sustainability of the electoral process in Armenia, leading to increased public trust in democratic governance.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective (impact) of the Project is to contribute towards achieving enhanced credibility, inclusiveness, and sustainability of the electoral process in Armenia, leading to increased public trust in democratic governance.

The specific objective (outcome) of the Project is to strengthen capacity and independence of the Central Electoral Commission (CEC) of Armenia to ensure credible, inclusive, transparent, and sustainable electoral processes by 2026 parliamentary elections

The Project will aim at supporting the institutional and professional capacities of the electoral management bodies, including the Central Electoral Commission and lower-level electoral commissions, as well as other institutional electoral stakeholders in Armenia.</narrative>
  </description>
